@startuml
left to right direction
actor "DMS Documents Officer" as Officer
rectangle "APGC DMS — document operations" {
  usecase "Create / submit own Memo\n[CURRENT: available to logged-in users]" as OwnMemo
  usecase "Receive intake / quality queue\n[FUTURE]" as Intake
  usecase "Register and correct operational metadata\n[FUTURE: scoped + audited]" as Register
  usecase "Handle authorized cross-owner documents\n[FUTURE: explicit permission]" as Handle
  usecase "Route business review task\n[CURRENT: owner selects reviewer]" as Route
}
Officer --> OwnMemo
Officer ..> Intake : target operations
Officer ..> Register : target operations
Officer ..> Handle : target operations
Officer --> Route
note bottom of OwnMemo
